{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52898","headline":"善恶二根不实偈 · 本净","name":"善恶二根不实偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善既从心生，恶岂离心有。\n善恶是外缘，於心实不有。\n舍恶送何处，取善令谁守？\n伤嗟二见人，攀缘两头走。\n忽悟无生本（《景德传灯录》作「若悟本无心」），始会（《景德传灯录》作「悔」）从前咎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}